  "body": "Rarely does an opportunity arise to purchase an ex-showhome, particularly one by Landmark Homes, thoughtfully designed to complement its coastal setting.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 532sqm site, this stunning family home offers an appealing combination of space, privacy and convenience. Tucked away at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac, with the added benefit of access from both the street and cul-de-sac, it offers flexibility and a sense of seclusion.\r\n\r\nDesigned with family living in mind, the home offers generous accommodation, including a spacious lower-level suite with its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. Ideal for teenagers, young adults, guests or extended family, it provides a welcome degree of independence and privacy.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the modern open-plan kitchen features quality appliances, including a gas cooktop, wall oven and dishwasher, flowing seamlessly into the dining area. Whether gathering with family or entertaining friends, this is a home designed to make everyday living easy.\r\n\r\nFeatures to appreciate:\r\n\r\nSunny position with northerly and easterly aspects and sea views\r\n\r\nCosy gas fireplace\r\n\r\nCentral heating and underfloor heating\r\n\r\nDedicated study\r\n\r\nDouble garage with internal access\r\n\r\nSeparate laundry\r\n\r\nBeautifully landscaped, fully fenced garden\r\n\r\nLouvre-covered deck and patio\r\n\r\nDouble glazing and security system\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to transport, shops and schools, this is a home that combines thoughtful design with practical family living in a desirable coastal neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nAn opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nConjunctional offers welcome. To view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/U5ZB",
